{"id": "1529049442207137902", "channel_id": "1526198306093531166", "author_id": "705407952575529022", "author_name": "water_heart", "content": "就只是寧菲亞具備繁育buff時會提高面板的「施加的中毒提高」的面板數值\n除去繁育加成計算可以發現這個中毒提高並沒有因為繁育的加成而變高\n像是下面這張圖\n「施加483層中毒，後續提高327層」繁育21\n釋放完這次狂氣爆發後下回合開始可以看見面板會是\n「施加810層中毒，後續提高327層」繁育21\n加了327層中毒...嗎？\n因為回合開始獲得了21層繁育所以這個面板很明顯不是原始數值\n大概只提高了270層中毒吧\n我想說的就只是這個繁育提高的中毒提高沒有影響到原始數值", "timestamp": "2026-07-21T08:56:35.387000+00:00", "type": 19, "thread_id": "1526198306093531166", "mentions": ["1485258210209435701"], "reactions": [{"emoji": "Nautila_think", "emoji_id": "1459077762684948500", "count": 1}], "attachments": [{"id": "1529049441569341591", "filename": "Screenshot_2026-07-13-19-42-23-333_com.qookkagames.z1.gp.hk.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 188506, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1526198306093531166/1529049441569341591/Screenshot_2026-07-13-19-42-23-333_com.qookkagames.z1.gp.hk.jpg?ex=6a6085c3&is=6a5f3443&hm=2213902a6762e905055c6a5f0e61d116d3dececce010bc8e7be32bef4457e2a4&"}, {"id": "1529049441884180611", "filename": "Screenshot_2026-07-13-19-42-54-829_com.qookkagames.z1.gp.hk.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 188586, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1526198306093531166/1529049441884180611/Screenshot_2026-07-13-19-42-54-829_com.qookkagames.z1.gp.hk.jpg?ex=6a6085c3&is=6a5f3443&hm=3c9732d08257f9a91daa4f3ee54be4aa053db48081c53ebf54635e52f8b210e5&"}], "reply_to": "1529044090702921798"}
